    <string name="accessibility_summary">Shows your screen in e-ink style</string>
    <string name="accessibility_description">PaperScreen redraws your screen in the style of an e-ink display, redrawing only what changes and occasionally clearing the screen with a full refresh. It uses this service to draw a full-screen overlay that your taps pass through, and to take a screenshot of each window underneath it, which it filters and shows on the overlay. It reads the window list only to know what to capture, and doesn\'t read or change anything inside apps. Captures stay on your phone.</string>

